<title>USA: NYSE closing averages.</title>
<headline>NYSE closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the New York Stock Exchange closed sharply lower in active trading Thursday. Financial markets will be closed for Good Friday.</p>
<p>The Dow Jones Industrial Average fell 140.11 to 6740.59. It ended the week down 64.20 points.</p>
<p>The NYSE Composite fell 7.94 to 407.43. It ended down 5.37 points for the week.</p>
<p>The average price per share was down $0.81.</p>
<p>Losers beat winners 2015 to 612.</p>
<p>Volume was 475,927,360 compared with 487,308,700 on Wednesday. Weekly volumed was 1,922,087,360.</p>
